1	SCH-157241	Our admission process is simple and transparent. Applicants are required to complete the registration form, provide necessary documentation, and follow the verification process. Admission is confirmed upon successful approval and fee submission.	To empower students with knowledge, skills, and values that prepare them to succeed in a dynamic and ever-changing world. askaksa	To deliver comprehensive education by combining innovative teaching methods, experienced faculty, and a value-based approach to nurture responsible citizens.	Our school is dedicated to providing quality education in a supportive and inspiring environment. We focus on academic excellence, character building, and overall development of every student. With experienced faculty and modern teaching methods, we strive to prepare students for future success.	2026-02-18 06:08:42.136536+00	2026-05-11 07:33:39.104512+00
11	SCH-132945	Application Form: Collect and submit the admission form from the school office or website.\nDocument Submission: Provide required documents such as birth certificate, previous school records, and photographs.\nAssessment/Interaction: Students may attend a simple assessment or interaction session.\nAdmission Confirmation: Selected students will receive admission confirmation.\nFee Payment: Complete the admission by paying the required fees.	Our mission is to provide high-quality education that encourages curiosity, creativity, and critical thinking. We strive to develop responsible citizens with strong values, knowledge, and skills needed to succeed in life.	Vision\n\nOur vision is to be a leading educational institution that inspires lifelong learning, promotes innovation, and empowers students to achieve their full potential and contribute positively to society.	About Us\n\nOur school is committed to providing quality education in a safe, supportive, and inspiring environment. We focus on academic excellence, character development, and nurturing the talents of every student. With dedicated teachers and modern learning methods, we aim to help students grow into responsible, confident, and successful individuals.	2026-03-12 16:08:11.170307+00	2026-03-12 16:09:33.767539+00
14	SCH-162172	Inquiry & Information Collection\nParents or students visit the school, website, or admission office to collect details about courses, fees, facilities, and eligibility.\nApplication Form Submission\nFill out the admission form online or offline and submit required documents such as:\nBirth certificate\nPrevious school records\nID proof\nPassport-size photographs\nEntrance Test / Interaction\nSome schools conduct:\nWritten entrance exams\nInterviews or interaction sessions with parents and students\nVerification of Documents\nThe school checks all submitted documents and eligibility criteria.\nSelection & Confirmation\nSelected students receive an admission confirmation through email, SMS, or notice board.\nFee Payment\nParents pay the admission fee and other required charges within the given deadline.\nFinal Enrollment\nAfter successful payment and verification, the student is officially enrolled and receives:\nAdmission number\nClass details\nBooks/uniform information\nAcademic schedule\nShort Professional Line\n\n“School admission is a step-by-step process that begins with application submission and ends with successful student enrollment after verification and fee payment.”	A CBSE school vision describes the school’s long-term goal and educational values. Here is a professional sample:\n\nCBSE School Vision Statement\n\n“To create a learning environment that nurtures academic excellence, moral values, creativity, discipline, and leadership qualities, empowering students to become responsible global citizens with confidence and compassion.”\n\nAnother Simple Version\n\n“Our vision is to provide quality education that inspires students to achieve excellence in academics, character, and life skills while promoting innovation, integrity, and lifelong learning.”\n\nShort Vision Line\n\n“Where learning meets excellence, values, and innovation.”	CBSE School Mission Statement\n\n“Our mission is to provide a holistic and student-centered education that promotes academic excellence, critical thinking, creativity, discipline, and moral values. We strive to create a safe and inclusive learning environment where every child is encouraged to explore their potential and become confident, responsible, and compassionate citizens.”\n\nSimple Version\n\n“Our mission is to nurture young minds through quality education, strong values, and innovative learning methods to prepare students for future success.”\n\nShort Mission Line\n\n“Empowering students through knowledge, values, and excellence.”	Sarada English Medium School is a modern CBSE-based educational institution dedicated to providing quality education with strong moral values and holistic development. The school aims to create a positive and inspiring learning environment where students are encouraged to achieve academic excellence, creativity, discipline, and leadership qualities.\n\nWith a perfect blend of modern teaching methods and value-based education, the school focuses on nurturing young minds to become confident, responsible, and compassionate citizens. Our experienced teachers, smart classrooms, co-curricular activities, and student-centered approach help every child discover and develop their unique talents.\n\nThe school believes that education is not only about academic success but also about building character, innovation, communication skills, and lifelong learning habits. We strive to prepare students to face future challenges with confidence and integrity.\n\nOur Vision\n\n“To inspire excellence in education, character, and innovation for a brighter future.”\n\nOur Mission\n\n“To provide holistic education through knowledge, discipline, creativity, and moral values in a safe and supportive environment.”	2026-05-11 09:46:55.260531+00	2026-05-11 09:53:08.866055+00
\.


